## Table of Contents
Although dynamic and flexible metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) have been closely assessed in recent literature, analysis into the subcategory of switchable MOFs has been comparably lacking. By virtue of their steady rise in popularity, MOFs with intriguing, switchable responsivity to light, temperature, pressure, redox species and guests are surveyed.
Keywords: Adsorption, Host-guest systems, Metal-organic frameworks, Molecular Devices, Switchable Materials
